"P3224281470" "The World Shatterer"
// DetailString :
"P4290250803" "In this future timeline, the Circle of Thorns referred to you as the World Shatterer. Obviously, they believe you're responsible for turning this world into a wasteland."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - WorldRuler 
