// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P924968010" "Alright, {VillainName}, y'know how we've been busy trying to get the people we need for Lord Recluse's pet project? Well, the whole thing is ready now, and now they need some guinea pigs to try it out. I volunteered you, saying that you've proven yourself to be real tough and can probably handle whatever is on the other side. I really just want to see you get ripped apart by the portal or whatever you find on the other side! <A HREF={ACCEPT}>If you want to prove me wrong, head over to talk with Operative Grillo.</A> He'll brief you on what you need to know.<br><br>Oh, and Grillo said you can bring some of your buddies, too. You might need it to face whatever is on the other side."
// AcceptString :
"P3154714304" "Test the Time/Space Portal"
// SendOffString :
"P315473664" "Grillo says they've reached enough success with the initial probes that sending a human subject is viable. You'll do!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission_1_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P521186848" "Speak with Operative Grillo"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P500010199" "What, you want me to hold your hand? Scared of the big bad Destiny Portal? Go and talk with Grillo already!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P685435689" "Ah, {VillainName}, Captain Mako told me to expect you. How is Mr. Mako doing these days? Isn't it fascinating how nature can evolve and adapt, resulting in such an interesting creature like him? But I digress.<br><br>You are about to embark on a bold adventure, to enter into realms unmapped. When you go through the Destiny Portal, you will take the first tentative steps into a future reality, one in which Lord Recluse reigns supreme! The very thought makes me giddy with anticipation!<br><br>But, we still need to test the portal some more. Our recent robotic probes through the Destiny Portal have returned successfully a good deal of the time. Now we need a sentient to test the portal - that's where you come in. Enter into the portal, then report your findings to me!"

