// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - DefeatAeon 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P2630861704" "Defeat Dr. Aeon"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2023097120" "Dr. Aeon swears up and down he hasn't been involved in Project DESTINY at all, so he doesn't know why he would have an interest in messing with it. However, a strange man named 'Professor Echo' warned him of a future where either you die or the world dies, and that Recluse plans to kill you to ensure he has a world to rule!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4171005243" "You interrogated Dr. Aeon regarding Project DESTINY!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1757030254" "That's quite a story. You have to die so the world can live? Sounds like Dr. Aeon is trying to pull one over you. I don't believe him, but from all accounts you gave him a sound thrashing. That's good enough for me!"
// RandomFameString :
"P3882504071" "Wow, {VillainName} sure has it in for Dr. Aeon!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission_3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P599853374" "So, I'm not inclined to believe what Dr. Aeon has to say, but what if he wasn't just trying to bluff his way out of getting beaten down? If Recluse has a hidden agenda, I want to know where I fit into it! There's a top-secret Arachnos base where they supposedly handle all the master plans of this Project DESTINY. If there's info on what Lord Recluse plans to do with us, it'll be there. I'm not normally paranoid - I leave that to Black Scorpion - but there's too much weirdness going on with this whole Project DESTINY. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Hit that base and find out what you can about our role in Project DESTINY!</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1310935517" "Find data on Project DESTINY"
// SendOffString :
"P1399502547" "Just to be clear here, I'm trying to save myself, not you. Sink or swim, buddy."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P4045649650" "Get movin', {VillainName}. If there's some Arachnos execution orders with our names on it, I want to know about it. I'm sure you do as well."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
