// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2130501833" "You say you were sent from the Project DESTINY base with these coordinates? Hrm, I didn't have anything scheduled, but I guess you wouldn't risk yourself without good reason. I'll have the technicians reset the Destiny Portal to your target future. Hope to see you back, {VillainName}."

