// ActiveTaskString :
"P3018698857" "Send Lord Recluse a warning"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2382645512" "So you did it, you took down Lord Recluse. Huh. I'm guessing in this future Lord Recluse is REAL old and feeble or something.<br><br>Well, you got something which is a HUGE bargaining chip. You know about what Lord Recluse has planned for you, and you've shown you can take 'im down when push comes to shove. I'd take that little souvenir of yours and show it to the big boss himself. If he doesn't try and kill you outright, he'll probably take it as a sign of strength and think twice about offin' ya. He's funny that way."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3045893834" "My helmet? Ah, you are far more enterprising than I anticipated. I understand there were some problems at the Project DESTINY base which resulted in the discovery of my contingency plans involving your demise, then an unauthorized use of the Destiny Portal. But I didn't quite expect... this.<br><br>You are strong, {VillainName}, I'll grant you that. I will take this as a very clear warning that you are not to be trifled with. I should view you instead as a possible ally in my future plans for world domination. Come speak with me when you are ready to step into a larger world. There is much we can do together!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2867478076" "I gotta say, {VillainName}, you got guts and a predator's instinct. That's about all the praise you're gonna get outta me, tho', so don't bother trying to get more. Now get outta here."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
